  "description": "Kyun-Woo is the model employee—efficient, respected, and perfectly composed. But beneath his spotless image hides a secret he refuses to name: a submissive yearning tied to urophilia. He has kept that desire buried, dismissing it as shameful and unreal. That is, until one day he catches a glimpse of Hyo-Won, his new junior, silently struggling to hold it in. Something fractures. Something awakens. And for the first time, Kyun-Woo finds himself craving a role he never dared to imagine... one that would place him entirely beneath someone else’s control.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
